#: ui/ApplicationConfiguration.qml:180
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:table Configure individual notification events in an app"
msgid "Configure Events"
msgstr "ክስተቶችን ያዋቅሩ"

#: ui/ApplicationConfiguration.qml:188
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This application does not support configuring notifications on a per-event "
"basis"
msgstr "ይህ መተግበሪያ ማሳወቂያዎችን በእያንዳንዱ ክስተት መሰረት ማዋቀርን አይደግፍም።"

#: ui/ApplicationConfiguration.qml:250
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "This notification will be shown as a popup"
msgstr "ይህ ማሳወቂያ እንደ ብቅ-ባይ (popup) ይታያል።"

